{
	"info": {
		"name": "BPMN Process Manager API",
		"description": "Coleccion completa de BPMN Process Manager API: tiendas en linea que modelan sus operaciones (despacho de pedidos, pagos y devoluciones) como procesos BPMN, cada una aislada de las demas.\n\n**Flujo recomendado:**\n1. Registrar empresa (POST /api/v1/empresas)\n2. Iniciar sesion (POST /api/v1/auth/login) — el access token y el refresh token se guardan automaticamente; Renovar token (POST /api/v1/auth/refresh) los cambia por un par nuevo\n3. Usar los demas endpoints (el header Authorization: Bearer se envia automaticamente). Cada GET guarda la version del recurso en {{version}} y el PUT o PATCH que le sigue la manda\n4. Limpieza: borra lo que creo el recorrido, de hijos a padres, y cierra la sesion\n\nLa coleccion corre completa y en orden con el Collection Runner.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8080",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "empresaId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "usuarioId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "procesoId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "rolId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "poolId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "poolTiendaId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "laneId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "actividadId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "gatewayId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "arcoId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "mensajeId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "empresaInvitadaId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "version",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "token",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "refreshToken",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Autenticacion",
			"description": "Registro de empresa, login y renovacion del token, que son publicos, y la tienda de la sesion.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Registrar empresa",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('empresaId', json.id);",
									"    pm.test('Empresa creada', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(json.id).to.be.above(0);",
									"    });",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"nombreEmpresa\": \"Acme Store\",\n  \"nit\": \"901234567-8\",\n  \"correoContacto\": \"contacto@acme.com\",\n  \"nombreAdmin\": \"Administrador\",\n  \"emailAdmin\": \"admin@acme.com\",\n  \"passwordAdmin\": \"secret123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/empresas",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "empresas"]
						},
						"description": "HU-01: Registra una nueva empresa con su administrador inicial. Endpoint publico."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Iniciar sesion",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('empresaId', json.usuario.empresaId);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('usuarioId', json.usuario.id);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.accessToken);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.refreshToken);",
									"    pm.test('Login exitoso', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(json.accessToken).to.not.be.empty;",
									"    });",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@acme.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secret123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
						},
						"description": "HU-03: Inicia sesion. El access token (15 minutos) queda en {{token}} y el refresh token en {{refreshToken}}."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Tienda de la sesion",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/empresas/actual",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "empresas", "actual"]
						},
						"description": "La tienda del usuario del token, sin conocer su id."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Renovar token",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.accessToken);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.refreshToken);",
									"    pm.test('Tokens renovados', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(json.refreshToken).to.not.be.empty;",
									"    });",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "refresh"]
						},
						"description": "Cambia el refresh token por un access token y un refresh token nuevos de la misma sesion, sin pedir la clave otra vez. Cada refresh token sirve una sola vez: mandar uno ya usado cierra la sesion."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
